      "id": "first-rule",
      "width": 980, "height": 309,
      "label": "An annotated FSL unit: (1) the header names the language and edition, (2) the profile says which part of the language the rules use, (3) the model line imports a domain package by its identity, (4) invariants must hold for every object, (5) a post rule compares a value after an operation with its value before.",
